      "caption": {
        "known": true,
        "value": "Craftable item prepared using a hefty cracked pot.\nA cocktail of effluents is sealed inside.\n\nThrow at enemies to set a large swarm of bloodflies upon them. The vile swarm deals damage and greatly builds up onset of blood loss. The cacophony of their wings assails the sanity of berserkers.\n\nThe maggots found in waste feed on blood and turn into vicious flies that are pitiably short-lived.",
